WEBVTT

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.560
Floating Bubbles...

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.360
Hey, listen to my voice,

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.360
this voice with
which I'm shouting...

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.780
I am here.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.490
I've turned my blood into a voice,

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.790
and I'm shouting at
the ends of the earth...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.250
I am a mermaid princess.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.830
A mermaid princess
who can never return.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.880
A little mermaid who will
vanish in a sea of bubbles...

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.420
Did you read it?
You read it, didn't you?

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.130
I-It's not what you think!
This is just, uh...

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:45.390
Right! It's not
a poem or anything!

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.100
The words just come pouring out of
my mouth on their own, that's all...

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:54.440
Moron! I hate you! You suck!
Unbelievable! Don't read it without asking!

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:57.690
Actually, why was it
on the ground, anyway?

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.690
I don't get it.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.790
So your name's Marie-chan, huh?

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:41.920
Cute...

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.460
Hey... Cut that out, will you?

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.170
It's kind of creepy!

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.550
She's not a student
at our school, is she?

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:51.970
Is she a friend from
your old school?

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:53.470
That's it!

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.810
Hey, you just jumped
on that, didn't you?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.560
Do you like it?

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:02.690
It's a specialty around
here, steak kabobs.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:04.190
It's really weird...

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:06.950
It's tough and hard to chew...

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:09.570
It was delicious.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.280
Oh, you thought it was delicious.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.290
It sure didn't seem
that way at first...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.330
She faked us out.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:19.540
W-Well... If you liked it, then fine!

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.880
What's this, green and red?

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.840
Green and red?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.590
Well, but we can't deny it.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:32.890
I'm not saying anything
mean. You look good.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.810
Th-Thanks...

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.980
So that was a compliment!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.060
She's a nice girl...

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.600
No question about it.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:43.730
Listen, you and Marie-chan...
Uh, are you guys going out?

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:45.320
No, not at all.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.360
I knew it!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:49.820
Great! Without you, this would
never get off the ground.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.490
My "Up Close and
Personal" Plan!

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:53.200
"Up Close and Personal"?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.510
What do you mean,
"Up Close and Personal"?

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.680
Kanji, you're still
too young to know.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.760
Why is that? Because
I just got over an illness?

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.430
No, because you can't get
a license yet at your age.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.810
Riding double with a girl,

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:22.560
and having her press up from
behind like a squeeze play!

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:25.860
That's all you need to know about
the Up Close and Personal Plan.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.940
Scooter
License
Study Guide

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.860
But wait... You can't ride
double on a scooter.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.280
What the...?

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.740
Did you know about that?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.530
Yes, I knew.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.580
Why didn't you tell him, then?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.370
Because Yosuke was
really enjoying himself.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.540
I don't need that
kind of thoughtfulness!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:46.630
Anyway, this is a huge snag
that could totally ruin my plan!

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:51.220
He's consumed with thoughts
of a squeeze play, huh?

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.630
Let's leave him be...

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:56.010
I don't care! Even if
it's just a scooter!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.680
Just having a motorcycle makes
the girls come running,

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.680
so that's all the
 advantage we need!

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.390
Is that how it works?

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:04.400
You don't have a clue!

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:09.690
A motorcycle is a surefire item for
increasing a man's pheromones!

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.820
F-Fillet mignon?

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:15.780
No, not fillet! Who's talking
about steak? Is it Satonaka?

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:17.240
Yosuke... sorry.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.910
I need to be somewhere.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.160
Oh, right.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.710
Anyway, we're getting our licenses,
so even if the squeeze play's not happening,

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.170
the Up Close and Personal
Plan is still on, okay?

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.290
Sure, let's do it.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.550
Without the squeezing.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:35.050
Jeez, what kind of
plan is that, exactly?

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:43.810
Well, that was a short-lived
dream, Yosuke.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.110
You like watching TV?

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.280
Not really. I just...

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.820
...wondered if you could
watch in that room, too.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.120
As long as there's an outlet.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.990
Got it. I'm going to tell The Nose.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.950
To put in an outlet.

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:04.330
Because I could die of
boredom in that room...

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.960
Good luck with that.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:10.460
If I can plug it in, I can watch Heckler
Entertainment Updates, too, right?

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.260
You don't know that show?

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.340
Heckle, heckle!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:18.260
Heckle, heckle?

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:20.060
Hey, Narukami-kun?

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.680
And Marie-chan, too?

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:24.350
It's Red and Green again...

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.730
We do look weird, don't we?

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:34.030
No, it's not weird.
But it's such a waste.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.570
Humans can change, can't they?

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:39.200
So you should try on
all sorts of things.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.200
Is that all there is to it?

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.540
But I never know what to pick...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.790
Yeah...

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.210
I know!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.580
Marie-chan, want to go
shopping for clothes with us?

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.210
Why?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:54.210
Well, you're so stylish,
Marie-chan. Right, Yukiko?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:57.720
Yes! You should join us, too,
Narukami-kun. What do you think?

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.390
Sure... In that case...

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.680
All righty! Then it's a done deal!

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:06.140
Marie-chan, when are you free?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.190
If it's not raining...
any day's okay.

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:14.360
What about you, Yukiko? I know
you're busy helping out at home.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.530
Yes... But I'm sure I can
get a day off sometime...

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.750
What's wrong?

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:33.710
I don't get it. I've never
made plans before, so...

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:37.300
It feels kind of strange...

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.340
I see.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:48.020
What? You got it already?

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.350
Driver License

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.350
Yu Narukami

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.140
Yes.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:52.360
Listen, Yu...

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.480
Of all things...

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.360
Vegetable Garden

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.230
Are you fighting?

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:59.490
No... We're just talking.

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:02.120
Yu got himself
a motorcycle license, see.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.700
A motorcycle?

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.990
Big Bro, that's so cool!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.960
Seriously, if something happens,
what am I supposed to tell my sister?

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:13.000
I won't do anything dangerous.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.420
And I'm going to work
part-time to buy the bike.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:16.670
So...

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.800
Guess it can't be helped...

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.560
Thanks for waiting!

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:35.360
Man, this is one awesome ride!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.070
Just get off already!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.240
What's this?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.570
That's my baby.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.530
I had her fixed up in the shop.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:46.870
All you gotta do is
fill 'er up and you'll be set.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.790
She's got a lot of mileage,
but she's a beast.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.920
She's yours.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.790
Take good care of her.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:56.210
Thank you very much!

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:04.760
This is an awesome bike...

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:08.600
It's me.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:12.520
<i>Uh, wait! I-Is this your
cell phone, Narukami-san?</i>

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:13.650
This is Narukami.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.480
<i>D-Don't scare me
like that! Really!</i>

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:20.030
<i>Listen, we're doing that
thing next Wednesday,</i>

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.320
<i>and we're meeting up in front of
Okina Station, at a shop called Croco Fur.</i>

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.360
That thing?

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.700
We talked about it, remember?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.450
Not sure that I do...

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.540
That's the only day that
Yukiko can take off.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:36.170
Well, anyway, we're looking forward to it,
so say hi to Marie-chan for me! Bye!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.250
Next Wednesday, huh?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:43.590
It's me.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.800
<i>And who's that?</i>

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.590
What's up?

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:49.390
<i>That plan... I'm thinking of
setting it in motion.</i>

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.100
<i>You got a motorcycle, didn't you?</i>

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.640
Yeah, I'm all set.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:55.600
<i>All right! I've managed to get
some wheels of my own, too.</i>

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:59.570
<i>Okay, so how about we head
to Okina City on our new bikes?</i>

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:00.570
Okina City?

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.740
It's the biggest shopping
district around here.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.320
You know, since this town
isn't big enough for us!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.740
<i>I see. That makes sense.</i>

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.040
All right, so how about
next Wednesday?

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.210
<i>I mean, that's the only day
I can get time off work, so...</i>

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.080
Sorry, next Wednesday I have...

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:22.280
<i>The reason you and I never got ourselves girlfriends
till now was because we didn't have motorcycles.</i>

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.470
Yosuke, listen...

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:26.550
<i>In other words, as of now,
we have no shortcomings!</i>

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:32.520
Throughout my sixteen years, I've never even
been asked by a girl to go shopping with her.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:36.980
Like, just following a girl wherever
she asks you to go... who would do that?

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.400
I mean, isn't that pretty lame?

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.610
I-I guess so...

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:46.240
But starting now, the rally is on!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.280
After all, we've got our motorcycles!

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.240
Uh... yeah...

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:54.290
So anyway, let's get pumped up
for next Wednesday!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.250
Oh, man, I can't wait!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.920
Romance is right round
the corner, partner!

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:05.420
Yosuke Hanamura

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:05.880
<i>That's the only day
I can get off from work...</i>

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:09.510
<i>That's the only day
that Yukiko can take off.</i>

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:13.430
<i>Romance is right round the corner,
partner! ...Partner! ...Partner!</i>

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.810
<i>I've never made
plans before, so...</i>

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.940
<i>It feels kind of strange...</i>

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.330
Yahoo!

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.210
<i>Such a smooth ride...</i>

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.840
<i>It feels fantastic.</i>

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:47.840
Hello, Okina Station!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.720
Hey, on a bike, it's not
such a long haul!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.770
Feel those looks
we're drawing already?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:59.100
Like we've already emitted
some bike pheromones!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:06.150
<i>I'm double-booked, but
this is the plan for today.</i>

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.610
Yu Narukami

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.610
Up Close and Personal Plan!  YU/YO/KAN

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.240
<i>First, at three, the Up Close and
Personal Plan gets underway.</i>

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.360
<i>I'm meeting up with Marie
and the others at four.</i>

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:19.250
Travel  YU

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:19.330
Girls / Shopping Time!  YU/CHI/YUKI/MA

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:16.330
<i>By 3:55 pm at the latest, I need to bail out of
the Up Close and Personal Plan, and get going.</i>

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.960
<i>Then from four, I'm going
shopping with the girls,</i>

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:23.670
<i>but I need to get home by six, or Nanako
will have to have dinner by herself.</i>

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:27.210
Dinner With Nanako  YU/NA

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.710
<i>That would be unforgivable!</i>

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.050
<i>Travel time should be
about one hour,</i>

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:33.300
Going Home - Return to My Home - YU

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:32.590
<i>meaning that I'll have to bail out of shopping
and leave Okina City by five at the latest.</i>

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:35.930
<i>In other words, the most time I can
spend on the Up Close and Personal Plan</i>

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:38.600
<i>and shopping with the girls is
just under one hour each.</i>

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:42.850
<i>This way, no one will get hurt, and
I'll be able to accomplish everything today!</i>

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:44.560
<i>It's perfect.</i>

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:47.070
Hey, someone's motivated!

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:55.910
Seriously, you followed us?

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:57.540
It was a breeze!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.790
Two guys getting used to their
scooters are no match for me!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.330
I don't get why it's even
a competition for you.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.090
All right...

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.670
Senpai, are we hanging out
here for a while?

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:09.300
You got somewhere to go?

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:13.010
Well, uh, I want some yarn...

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.260
Yarn?

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:16.010
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.810
Anyway, what difference
does it make?

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.520
I have an errand to run!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.770
And I'm going.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.520
Even if you stop me, I'm going!

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:23.900
See ya!

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.440
Nobody's stopping you...

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:28.190
So what's the plan now?

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:31.610
Well, of course, girls will be drawn
to us even if we don't do anything.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.860
After all, we've got
our motorcycles.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.740
Is that how this works?

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.620
Marie-chan!

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.460
Sorry, did we keep you waiting?

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:47.000
I don't mind. I have
nothing to do anyway.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.250
Just have to wait for
Narukami-kun now, huh?

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:59.060
I don't get it.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.600
I can feel everyone's
eyes on me...

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.640
And it's such an awesome bike...

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.440
Sorry!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.650
I'm late... Huh?

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.440
You came up empty, then?

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:12.990
Isn't it obvious?

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:16.950
<i>This isn't the plan,
but time to go, huh?</i>

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:17.950
Yosuke...

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.740
Senpai, give me
ten minutes, will you?

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.360
I can't stand by and do nothing
when you've been shut out like this.

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:26.000
I'm gonna go avenge you both!

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:29.420
Avenge us? Wait, what are you
gonna do, hit on some girls?

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.550
In a situation like this,
what else am I gonna do?

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.420
Hold up... Calm down, Kanji!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.050
How the hell can I calm down?

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:37.470
We've got motorcycles,
and we're still striking out,

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:39.300
so what makes you think
you can avenge us?

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:42.560
If you give it some time,
you might get lucky with a few!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.340
Now you've said it. Okay,
then let's make this a contest!

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:47.270
How many numbers
you can get in an hour!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:48.770
New - Showdown! / Pickup Contest  YU/YO/KAN

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:57.360
All right, so starting now,
over the next hour...

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.700
Make it three minutes.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.620
I bet I can get it done
in three minutes.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:04.620
Showdown! / Pickup Contest  YU/YO/KAN

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.210
We're wasting time.
Let's get started!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.920
Way to go, Senpai!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:12.090
Okay, if I lose, I'll run the town
marathon in nothing but my shorts!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.130
If I lose, I'll do the same
wearing gag glasses!

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:16.930
If you're gonna take it that far,

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:20.930
then maybe we should let Nanako-chan
see you in just your shorts and gag glasses!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.180
Big Bro...

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.600
<i>I can't afford to lose!</i>

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:30.360
Let's meet up here
again in an hour, okay?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.110
- Right!
- Yo!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.610
Let's go... Pickup
Contest, ready... go!

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:36.360
Hello.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.110
I'm Yu Narukami.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:39.610
Nice to meet you.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.410
Is there an election, dear?

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.870
So I struck out...

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.670
No, it's still too early. I don't
have to panic just yet.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.750
We have an hour to compete.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.770
Cont. - Showdown! / Pickup Contest  YU/YO/KAN

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:53.130
If I can manage to hit on someone
during the shopping spree,

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.920
I should be able to
turn this around!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.510
You only reached for it after me!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.130
Sorry I'm late...

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:58.630
So what do you mean by that?

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.090
Would you mind not
making false accusations?

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.180
Huh? Who's accusing who?

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:03.470
I grabbed it first!

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:04.430
What happened?

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:05.890
Oh, Narukami-kun...

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:08.730
You were too late,
so don't make stuff up!

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:10.810
Well, it seems that Ebihara-san also
likes the skirt that Chie picked out,

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.270
Doesn't make any difference.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:13.060
They only have it
in this size, so give it up!

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.060
and there's only one
left in that size.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.230
You wouldn't look
good in this anyway!

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.860
Then she said that Chie wouldn't
look good in it anyway,

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:16.990
Oh yes I would!

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:17.820
and now Chie's having a fit...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.070
Not in a million years.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.400
Calm down, both of you...

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:20.410
Who are you to talk, you're
always dressed like a loser!

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:22.450
Is this person...
Could she be a "gyaru"?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.070
How dare you!
You're so stuck-up!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.030
What did you say?

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:28.000
No eyebrows. Shiny
forehead. Really pungent.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.370
What the...? This is
a brand-name perfume!

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.290
Are you trying to pick a fight?

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.460
No, I'm not.
It suits you well.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.760
Hey, don't take it out
on Marie-chan!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:37.510
Shut up!

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:40.050
If you're going to be
that stubborn,

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:42.890
let's make it a Coordinating Contest to see
who has the right to wear this skirt...

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:43.930
You're on!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.350
Narukami-kun!
Will you be our judge?

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.520
A guy should judge something
like this, or else there's no point.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.020
Now play fair, okay?

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.980
H-Hold on a second. I...

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:53.190
We'll take an hour to compete.

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:56.780
We'll pick out a theme, and coordinate
ourselves head-to-toe. Okay?

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.690
You betcha!

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.610
Round 1 will be
Conservative Mode!

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.910
I'm not sure what
that means, but I'm in!

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.600
New - Really Popular?! / Coordinating Contest YU/CHI

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:07.660
It's me.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.580
<i>Yo! Well, how are
the pickups going?</i>

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.370
I-I'm right on track.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:12.790
<i>O-Oh yeah?</i>

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:15.750
<i>Well, I'm totally on track
over here myself!</i>

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:16.920
Y-You are?

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.630
<i>I don't see myself losing now!</i>

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:22.880
<i>Actually, I've asked for so many addresses,
my smartphone's memory is crammed!</i>

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.680
Big Bro...

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.680
Nanako!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.770
<i>I can't afford to lose!</i>

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:36.400
Today, the world is teeming with evil
spirits, and overflowing with despair...

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:38.530
Are you the oldest son? The second son?
Do you have your own place?

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.780
Does your family rent or
own? Or is it a co-op?

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:43.360
My sealed demonic
eyes are squirming...

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.070
Here's a gas canister!

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:48.580
I didn't think he'd really do it!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.370
It's totally hysterical, but...

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:54.580
It's me.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:57.380
<i>Hey, Narukami-kun?
Where are you?</i>

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.710
I'll be right there!

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:02.550
Oh, here he is.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:06.550
You're late! I mean, who ever
heard of a judge going M.I.A.?

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:10.060
Well, who's your pick?
Which of us looks better?

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:11.810
Draw!

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.690
Okay, Round 2 will
be Forest Girl Mode.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:17.150
I wouldn't have it
any other way!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.110
Chie, I think you've had enough...

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:22.320
Draw!

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.320
Draw!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.080
You know, I don't get
why you're such a mess.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.620
You're not taking your
judging duties lightly, are you?

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.500
Yes?

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.590
<i>Hello? Big Bro?</i>

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:42.760
Is that you, Nanako?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:46.840
<i>Guess what? Dad says he's
coming home at five today!</i>

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.720
<i>So he said we should
all have dinner together!</i>

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.390
New - Dinner with Nanako (Complete) YU/NA/RYO

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:57.350
Nanako... Are you listening?

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:58.560
<i>Yes...</i>

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:03.990
Just wait for me... Nanako...
I promise... I promise I'll get home...

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.070
<i>Okay! I'll be waiting!</i>

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.960
Yes... You both look good.

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.920
This is... Adorable...

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:27.470
No way... It's like
I'm someone else!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:30.100
You're amazing, Marie-chan!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.060
You coordinated them
both in no time!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:37.440
Hey, listen. I'd like you to pick out
some outerwear that would go with this.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.400
Sure, I don't mind...

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.190
Marie-chan, would you mind
picking out something for me, too?

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.530
Me, too! Find
another outfit for me!

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:45.530
Oh... Okay.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.900
All of you... you're beautiful.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.240
Ta-da!

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:57.460
I got myself one number!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:59.250
I lost...

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:00.420
Gag glasses for me, huh?

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.750
Are you okay, Senpai?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.590
And I'm running late...

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:05.960
Nanako...

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.090
Oh, man, that was a slog!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.090
She was a total babe, this girl.

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:13.430
Well, hold onto your seats!

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:15.850
Oh! Nice talking
to you just now.

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.850
I'm the guy who wants to
give you a motorcycle ride!

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.520
<i>Hanamura-kun?</i>

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:21.400
Right, it's me, it's me!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.810
Wait, huh?

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.190
My name...

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:25.190
How did you...?

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:26.650
What do you mean?

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.740
Of course I know it...

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:31.740
We go to the same
school, after all.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.160
O-O-O-Otani-san!
What are you doing here?

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:39.540
The boonies just don't
do it for me, you know?

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:42.540
I was shopping and
then suddenly you called.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:46.340
D-Don't tell me I dialed
the wrong number?

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.470
A motorcycle ride, huh?

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:52.050
Well, if you insist, then
I don't mind going with you.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:53.680
Hold... on...!

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:09.440
M-M-M-My...
My... motorcycle...

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:09.440
Are you serious?
This motorcycle's busted.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:16.490
If you want to ask me out,
you need to try harder.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:25.210
So it's a draw, then?

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:27.590
Let's go home... Yu...

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:31.010
I wonder where
Narukami-kun went off to?

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:34.090
I know, right? But
that was fun today, huh?

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:37.350
Hey, come hang out with us
again sometime, Marie-chan!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:38.930
Why?

00:21:38.930 --> 00:21:42.060
What do you mean, why?
Because we're all friends!

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:43.400
Friends?

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.060
Is that right?

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:49.480
Wait, Marie-chan, don't tell me that...
you didn't have a good time?

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:52.030
Did we annoy you by asking?

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:55.950
N-No... you weren't annoying.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:57.450
Hanamura Senpai!

00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:59.540
Ride double with me!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.000
No, I hate to tell you, but it's against
the law to ride double on bicycles, too.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.330
What the heck are
those guys doing?

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.380
There's Narukami-kun, too.

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:10.300
Did something happen, I wonder?

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:12.630
Oh, they're probably
just being morons again.

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:14.300
Let's go, Yukiko, Marie-chan.

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:15.300
Okay!

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:19.850
Wh-What are you guys doing here?

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:20.520
What were you up to?

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:21.810
An Up Close and Personal Plan!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:22.430
What's the matter, Narukami-kun?

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:24.810
Friends... huh?

00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:59.410
Vegetable Garden

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.500
Welcome home, Big Bro!

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:09.120
You were out late.

00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:10.420
Nanako...

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:13.210
I'm home...

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:15.260
now...

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:20.300
Ta-da!

00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:21.890
He has no delicacy!

00:24:21.890 --> 00:24:22.760
What a bigass!

00:24:22.760 --> 00:24:24.100
You're wrong!

00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:25.140
I'm too much!

00:24:25.140 --> 00:24:27.270
Hey... what's youth?

00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:29.230
I'm ready to be born, dammit!
